# Deep Gnome Terramancer's ChangesZoneAll trigger reads ValidCause$
# LandAbility with InvertValidCause$ True (CardTraitBase.java:260-266): a land
# an opponent plays (a land play is the cause) does not fire it; the Forest
# the AI's Rampant Growth puts onto the battlefield does, so the human
# searches for a Plains and puts it onto the battlefield tapped.
startturn ai
advance 3
queue action ai playland 12
passpriority
tapformana ai 10 G
tapformana ai 11 G
queue paygeneric G
queue cardchoice 14
queue optionaltrigger true
queue cardchoice 2
castspell ai 13
resolvestack
resolvestack
